<h2 id="obsolete-section-obsolete-on-spaces" class="tex-section"><span data-tag="0D45">115.17</span> Obsolete lemmas on algebraic spaces</h2>

<p>
Lemmas that seem superfluous or are no longer used in the text. 
</p>
<p>
<article class="env-lemma" id="07V2">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/07V2">Lemma <span data-tag="07V2">115.17.1</span>.</a> In Cohomology of Spaces, Situation <a href="/tag/07UY" data-tag="07UY">69.16.1</a> the morphism $p : X \to \mathop{\mathrm{Spec}}(A)$ is surjective. </p>
</article> 
</p>
<article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      This lemma was originally used in the proof of Cohomology of Spaces, Proposition <a href="/tag/07V6" data-tag="07V6">69.16.7</a> but now is a consequence of it. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>
<p>
<article class="env-lemma" id="07V3">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/07V3">Lemma <span data-tag="07V3">115.17.2</span>.</a> In Cohomology of Spaces, Situation <a href="/tag/07UY" data-tag="07UY">69.16.1</a> the morphism $p : X \to \mathop{\mathrm{Spec}}(A)$ is universally closed. </p>
</article> 
</p>
<article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      This lemma was originally used in the proof of Cohomology of Spaces, Proposition <a href="/tag/07V6" data-tag="07V6">69.16.7</a> but now is a consequence of it. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>
